# CAN11h frame switches only
# chip: FLS
# baseline: EDC16C35 SW 1037390198 HW 0281013852, stock FLS md5 946ac4996562d619c14208006daef0e7
# doc: docs/CAN11h.md
#
# The frame switch block on its own, without the descriptor fields or the
# runnable swap. This is the part a factory CAN11h car (E53) also has set.
#
# Pair this with can11h_variant3.patch for the factory configuration, or try
# it alone first to find out whether the rest of can11h.patch is needed at all.
#
# format:  <addr>  <stock hex> -> <new hex>   # note
# checksums are NOT in this file; applypatch.py recomputes them.

0x0D9221  0000000001000000000000 -> 0101010100010101010101  # FrmMng switches ASC1..EGS2 (swtCANA 01->00)
